Subject: CromIKO Incognito Tile

Add an "Incognito tab" tile for Android's Quick Settings. Tapping it
opens a new incognito tab in CromIKO, the same way as the "New
incognito tab" launcher shortcut; on a locked phone it asks to unlock
first. Add it by editing the Quick Settings tiles.

